## 📌 2. Math — Mathematical Operations

> No import needed — `java.lang.Math` is auto-imported.

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(Math.max(10, 20));       // 20
        System.out.println(Math.min(10, 20));       // 10
        System.out.println(Math.abs(-45));          // 45
        System.out.println(Math.sqrt(64));          // 8.0
        System.out.println(Math.pow(2, 5));         // 32.0
        System.out.println(Math.round(4.7));        // 5
        System.out.println(Math.random());          // 0.0 to 1.0
        System.out.println(Math.PI);                // 3.141592...
    }
}
```

