## 📌 3. Date & Time — `java.time` (Java 8+)

```java
import java.time.LocalDate;
import java.time.LocalTime;
import java.time.LocalDateTime;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        LocalDate date = LocalDate.now();
        LocalTime time = LocalTime.now();
        LocalDateTime dt = LocalDateTime.now();

        System.out.println("Date : " + date);   // 2025-01-15
        System.out.println("Time : " + time);   // 14:30:25.123
        System.out.println("Both : " + dt);     // 2025-01-15T14:30:25
    }
}
```

| Class | Use |
|---|---|
| `LocalDate` | Date only (year, month, day) |
| `LocalTime` | Time only (hour, min, sec) |
| `LocalDateTime` | Date + Time together |

