## 🧠 Quick Recap

| Library | Package | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `Scanner` | `java.util` | Take user input |
| `Math` | `java.lang` (auto) | Math operations |
| `LocalDate/Time` | `java.time` | Date and time |
| `File / FileWriter` | `java.io` | Read/write files |
| `Integer, Double...` | `java.lang` (auto) | Primitive → Object |

